<p style="margin: 0 auto; max-width: 38em; text-align: center; font-size: clamp(19px, 1.6vw, 22px); line-height: 1.5; color: #3B3552">Three days of the school holidays in a room full of girl geeks: new friends, mentors beside you, and an app that’s yours by Thursday.</p>
