<section class="shs-g shs-dd" style="position: relative; z-index: 1; background-image: linear-gradient(180deg, #4b3773 0%, #35265a 50%, #1B1530 100%); color: #ffffff; padding: clamp(40px, 5vw, 72px) 20px 64px">
<div style="position: relative; z-index: 3; max-width: 1160px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: clamp(36px, 4.5vw, 56px)">
<div id="mentors" class="shs-glass" style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16); box-shadow: 0 24px 48px -30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7); border-radius: 30px; padding: clamp(28px, 4vw, 52px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 26px; scroll-margin-top: 90px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px">
<h2 id="shs-mentors" style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Piñata LimesSans-Black', sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(38px, 5vw, 64px); line-height: 1.0; letter-spacing: 0.02em; text-wrap: balance; text-align: left; color: #ffffff; text-transform: uppercase">Swift developer? Mentor with us</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 20px; color: #E9DFFF">We need Swift and iOS developers to:</p>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 28px 56px">
<div style="flex: 999 1 420px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 26px">
<ul style="margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; font-size: 18px; color: #ffffff">
<li style="display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: flex-start"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#FFC37A" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="flex: 0 0 22px; margin-top: 3px"><path d="M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5"></path></svg><span>Mentor in the room in Sydney, 12–14 January (full or half days)</span></li><li style="display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: flex-start"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#FFC37A" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="flex: 0 0 22px; margin-top: 3px"><path d="M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5"></path></svg><span>Give a 15-minute “how I got into iOS” talk on Day 1</span></li><li style="display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: flex-start"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#FFC37A" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="flex: 0 0 22px; margin-top: 3px"><path d="M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5"></path></svg><span>Sit on the Day 3 showcase feedback panel</span></li><li style="display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: flex-start"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#FFC37A" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="flex: 0 0 22px; margin-top: 3px"><path d="M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5"></path></svg><span>Mentor online from any city, about an hour a week through January and February</span></li>
</ul>
<img src="/images/shehacksswift/photo-M79.webp" alt="A speaker talking to students around the room" width="900" height="600" style="display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; aspect-ratio: 16 / 8; object-fit: cover; object-position: 50% 40%; border-radius: 20px">
</div>
<div style="flex: 1 1 300px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px">
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5; color: #ffffff; font-weight: 600">You’ll help girls shape an idea, test it with their crew and trim it to a three-minute app playground.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55; color: #E9DFFF">Mentors need a Working With Children Check (free for NSW volunteers) and join a one-hour online onboarding in December. Mentors coach and explain. They can look things up with a student, but they never type code into a student’s project.</p>
